# Root safety-net ignores. Nested apps (e.g. apps/web) also have their own
# .gitignore; these rules match at ANY depth to catch stray/doubled paths.

# Dependencies & build output
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets (never commit real env files; .env.example is allowed)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# OS / editor
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
